# Generate m12 L12A b07 dial quality Priya scene asset

## Goal

Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-12/m12_L12A_b07_dial-quality_priya.png`.

## Scope

- Use the attached BMH course doodle references and locked flat sticker-sheet style.
- Keep Priya identical to `course-assets/scenes/module-12/_anchors/priya.png`.
- Use the built-in image generation workflow with the requested gpt-image-2 prompt.
- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
- Show exactly one person, Priya, at a desk late in the day.
- Priya is rushed speed-dialing, with shoulders forward, one hand tapping a desk phone keypad, and the other hand on a blank call list.
- Add a simple round wall clock behind the desk pointing near 4 o'clock with only hands and tick marks.
- Keep the background plain cornflower blue.
- Use thick wobbly black outlines, rounded simple shapes, flat fills only, and the locked palette: cornflower blue, sunflower yellow, tangerine orange, pale cream or warm white, and black.
- Avoid extra people, text, words, letters, numbers, logos, ambient doodles, speech bubbles, thought bubbles, motion marks, decorative marks, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective depth.

## Verification

- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
- Visually inspect for exactly one person, Priya identity match, rushed phone tapping, blank call-list lines, a simple clock near 4 o'clock with no numerals, plain blue background, and no text or extra props.

